    "content": {
      "rendered": "<div id=\"fh-jobpost\">\n<div style=\"background:#E4F3EA;border-left:5px solid #1E8E4E;border-radius:10px;padding:16px 18px;margin:0 0 22px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#123D28;\"><strong>Quick answer:</strong> Rubrik Winter Internship 2027 is open for three onsite intern roles at Rubrik&rsquo;s Bangalore office: Software Engineer, Software Engineer (CPD) and ENG Project/Program Intern. All three need a CGPA of 8 or more, a 2027 graduation year in a circuital branch, and full-time availability from January to May 2027. Stipend is not published.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;margin:0 0 24px;\">\n<div style=\"background:#0F3D2A;color:#fff;font-weight:800;font-size:17px;padding:13px 18px;\">Rubrik Winter Internship 2027 &mdash; job details at a glance</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Company</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Rubrik, Inc. (NYSE: RBRK)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Roles</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Software Engineer &ndash; Winter Intern (8166523) &middot; Software Engineer (CPD) &ndash; Winter Intern (8166537) &middot; ENG Project/Program &ndash; Intern (8166514)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Location</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Bangalore (Bengaluru), onsite &ndash; no remote option</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Duration</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">January 2027 to May 2027</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Batch</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">2027 graduates only</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Branches</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Circuital branches only (CSE, IT, ECE, EEE and similar)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Minimum CGPA</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">8.0 and above</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Stipend</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Official: Not disclosed | Reported: &#8377;1&ndash;1.8 lakh per month (Indian job-board listings, unverified)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Selection process</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">Not published by Rubrik</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex:1 1 260px;border-top:1px solid #EDF1EF;padding:12px 18px;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6C7B74;font-weight:700;\">Status</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:16.5px;color:#18241E;font-weight:600;margin-top:3px;\">All three roles open on Rubrik&rsquo;s Greenhouse board (re-checked 21 Nov 2026)</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin:0 0 24px;\"><a href=\"https://www.rubrik.com/company/careers/departments/job.8166523?gh_jid=8166523\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block;flex:1 1 240px;text-decoration:none;background:#1E3A8A;border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:800;font-size:15.5px;color:#FFFFFF;\">Software Engineer &ndash; Winter Intern</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:#BFDBFE;margin-top:4px;\">Job ID 8166523 &middot; Apply</span></a><a href=\"https://www.rubrik.com/company/careers/departments/job.8166537?gh_jid=8166537\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block;flex:1 1 240px;text-decoration:none;background:#1E3A8A;border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:800;font-size:15.5px;color:#FFFFFF;\">Software Engineer (CPD) &ndash; Winter Intern</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:#BFDBFE;margin-top:4px;\">Job ID 8166537 &middot; Apply</span></a><a href=\"https://www.rubrik.com/company/careers/departments/job.8166514?gh_jid=8166514\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block;flex:1 1 240px;text-decoration:none;background:#1E3A8A;border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;text-align:center;\"><span style=\"display:block;font-weight:800;font-size:15.5px;color:#FFFFFF;\">ENG Project/Program &ndash; Intern</span><span style=\"display:block;font-size:12.5px;color:#BFDBFE;margin-top:4px;\">Job ID 8166514 &middot; Apply</span></a></div>\n<div id=\"ez-toc-container\" class=\"ez-toc-v2_0_90 counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-light-blue ez-toc-container-direction\">\n<div class=\"ez-toc-title-container\"><p class=\"ez-toc-title\" style=\"cursor:inherit\">Job Summary</p>\n</div><nav><ul class='ez-toc-list ez-toc-list-level-1 ' ><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-1\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/rubrik-winter-internship-2027/#Rubrik_Winter_Internship_2027_%E2%80%93_full_job_details\" >Rubrik Winter Internship 2027 &ndash; full job details</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-2\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/rubrik-winter-internship-2027/#What_you_will_do_in_the_Rubrik_Winter_Internship_2027_role\" >What you will do in the Rubrik Winter Internship 2027 role</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-3\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/rubrik-winter-internship-2027/#Rubrik_Winter_Internship_2027_eligibility\" >Rubrik Winter Internship 2027 eligibility</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-4\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/rubrik-winter-internship-2027/#Expected_salary_for_the_Rubrik_Winter_Internship_2027\" >Expected salary for the Rubrik Winter Internship 2027</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-5\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/rubrik-winter-internship-2027/#Rubrik_Winter_Internship_2027_selection_process\" >Rubrik Winter Internship 2027 selection process</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-6\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/rubrik-winter-internship-2027/#Documents_required_for_the_Rubrik_Winter_Internship_2027\" >Documents required for the Rubrik Winter Internship 2027</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/rubrik-winter-internship-2027/#Preparation_tips_for_the_Rubrik_Winter_Internship_2027\" >Preparation tips for the Rubrik Winter Internship 2027</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/rubrik-winter-internship-2027/#How_to_apply_for_Rubrik_Winter_Internship_2027\" >How to apply for Rubrik Winter Internship 2027</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/rubrik-winter-internship-2027/#About_Rubrik\" >About Rubrik</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class=\"ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-10\" href=\"https://freshershunt.in/rubrik-winter-internship-2027/#Frequently_asked_questions\" >Frequently asked questions</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Rubrik_Winter_Internship_2027_%E2%80%93_full_job_details\"></span>Rubrik Winter Internship 2027 &ndash; full job details<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">The Rubrik Winter Internship 2027 cycle covers three separate openings, each with its own application. Two are core engineering seats, one on a product team and one in Continuous Product Development (CPD), the group that owns mature Rubrik products end to end. The third is a programme management seat inside the engineering organisation.</p>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">Every Rubrik Winter Internship 2027 role is based in Bangalore and runs for roughly five months starting January 2027. Rubrik builds data security and cyber-recovery software, so interns work on real storage, backup and cloud code rather than demo projects. You can apply to more than one role if your profile fits each of them.</p>\n<div style=\"background:#FDEBEA;border-left:5px solid #C8372B;border-radius:10px;padding:15px 18px;margin:0 0 20px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#5B1A14;\"><strong>Four hard filters apply to every role:</strong> CGPA 8.0 or above, graduating in 2027, circuital branch only, and available onsite in Bangalore from January to May 2027. If you miss any one of these, your application is unlikely to be considered.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#FFF6E3;border-left:5px solid #E1A006;border-radius:10px;padding:15px 18px;margin:0 0 20px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:#4A3706;\">Rubrik has not published the stipend, the number of seats or a closing date. Treat the &ldquo;reported&rdquo; stipend below as a market estimate, not an offer.</p>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"What_you_will_do_in_the_Rubrik_Winter_Internship_2027_role\"></span>What you will do in the Rubrik Winter Internship 2027 role<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\"><strong>Software Engineer and Software Engineer (CPD) interns</strong> will:</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Design, write, test and ship features in Rubrik&rsquo;s product code</li>\n<li>Find and fix performance bottlenecks in the software stack</li>\n<li>Own the priorities and deadlines of an individual project</li>\n<li>CPD interns focus on improving and maintaining established products end to end</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\"><strong>ENG Project/Program interns</strong> in the Rubrik Winter Internship 2027 will:</p>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Help define programme scope, milestones and success metrics</li>\n<li>Maintain project plans, schedules and dashboards that track KPIs</li>\n<li>Share status updates with engineering, product and support teams</li>\n<li>Flag delivery risks early and help draft mitigation plans</li>\n<li>Suggest tools that make delivery faster and capture lessons learned</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Rubrik_Winter_Internship_2027_eligibility\"></span>Rubrik Winter Internship 2027 eligibility<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li><strong>Degree:</strong> Bachelor&rsquo;s or Master&rsquo;s in Computer Science or a related field (Program role also accepts Engineering or Information Systems)</li>\n<li><strong>Batch:</strong> 2027 graduates only</li>\n<li><strong>Branch:</strong> circuital branches only</li>\n<li><strong>CGPA:</strong> 8.0 and above</li>\n<li><strong>Coding (engineering roles):</strong> good command of at least one language such as Java, C/C++, Scala or Python</li>\n<li><strong>Program role:</strong> basic SDLC and agile knowledge, strong organisation and communication; AWS/Azure/GCP or storage exposure is a plus</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\"><em>Not confirmed by Rubrik:</em> whether dual-degree students, backlogs or non-circuital minors are accepted. The JD is silent on these, so check with the recruiter before you assume either way.</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Expected_salary_for_the_Rubrik_Winter_Internship_2027\"></span>Expected salary for the Rubrik Winter Internship 2027<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">Rubrik does not state the stipend. Indian job boards that carried earlier Rubrik winter intern listings show figures between &#8377;1 lakh and &#8377;1.8 lakh per month. AmbitionBox and Glassdoor have no India intern data for Rubrik yet, and Levels.fyi lists only US intern pay. Use these numbers as a rough guide and confirm the exact stipend in writing at offer stage.</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Rubrik_Winter_Internship_2027_selection_process\"></span>Rubrik Winter Internship 2027 selection process<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">Rubrik has not published the Rubrik Winter Internship 2027 selection rounds. Based on how product companies usually hire interns, plan for this sequence:</p>\n<ol style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Resume shortlist against the CGPA, batch and branch filters</li>\n<li>Online coding test (data structures, algorithms, debugging)</li>\n<li>One or two technical interviews (coding plus systems or CS fundamentals)</li>\n<li>A final round with a manager; Program candidates should expect a case-style discussion on planning and risk</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Documents_required_for_the_Rubrik_Winter_Internship_2027\"></span>Documents required for the Rubrik Winter Internship 2027<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Updated one-page resume &ndash; build one free with our <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/resume-builder/\">Resume Builder</a></li>\n<li>Latest semester mark sheets showing CGPA</li>\n<li>College ID or bonafide certificate showing 2027 graduation</li>\n<li>Links to GitHub, LeetCode or project work (engineering roles)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Preparation_tips_for_the_Rubrik_Winter_Internship_2027\"></span>Preparation tips for the Rubrik Winter Internship 2027<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ul style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Practise arrays, strings, trees, graphs and dynamic programming for the coding test</li>\n<li>Revise operating systems, file systems and networking basics &ndash; useful for a storage company</li>\n<li>Prepare one project you can explain in depth, including trade-offs you made</li>\n<li>Program applicants: be ready to walk through a plan, a timeline and a risk list for a sample feature</li>\n<li>Use our free <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/tools/\">career tools</a> and practise your <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/self-introduction-for-interview/\">self-introduction for interview</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"How_to_apply_for_Rubrik_Winter_Internship_2027\"></span>How to apply for Rubrik Winter Internship 2027<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<ol style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.8;margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;color:#24312B;\">\n<li>Pick the role that suits you: <a href=\"https://www.rubrik.com/company/careers/departments/job.8166523?gh_jid=8166523\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Software Engineer &ndash; Winter Intern</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rubrik.com/company/careers/departments/job.8166537?gh_jid=8166537\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Software Engineer (CPD) &ndash; Winter Intern</a> or <a href=\"https://www.rubrik.com/company/careers/departments/job.8166514?gh_jid=8166514\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" target=\"_blank\">ENG Project/Program &ndash; Intern</a></li>\n<li>Click Apply on the Rubrik careers page and fill the Greenhouse form</li>\n<li>Upload your resume and enter your CGPA and graduation year exactly as on your mark sheet</li>\n<li>Submit and watch your email (including spam) for the test link</li>\n</ol>\n<div style=\"background:#F3F6F4;border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;margin:0 0 20px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#43514A;\"><strong>Related:</strong> <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/rubrik-program-manager-internship-2027/\">Rubrik Program Manager Internship 2027</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/rubrik-application-security-internship-2026/\">Rubrik Application Security Internship</a> &middot; <a href=\"https://freshershunt.in/companies-hiring-freshers/\">Companies hiring freshers</a></p>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"About_Rubrik\"></span>About Rubrik<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<p style=\"font-size:16.5px;line-height:1.75;margin:0 0 14px;color:#24312B;\">Rubrik is a US-listed cybersecurity company focused on data security, identity and AI operations. Its platform helps enterprises protect backups, detect threats and recover quickly after attacks. Bangalore is one of its largest engineering centres, and many full-time offers come from its intern pool, which makes the Rubrik Winter Internship 2027 a strong entry point.</p>\n<h2 style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:23px;line-height:1.3;margin:26px 0 12px;color:#111;\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"Frequently_asked_questions\"></span>Frequently asked questions<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\"></span></h2>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">What is the stipend for the Rubrik Winter Internship 2027?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">Rubrik has not disclosed it. Indian job-board listings for earlier Rubrik winter intern roles report about &#8377;1&ndash;1.8 lakh per month, but this is unverified. Confirm the figure in your offer letter.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">Who is eligible for the Rubrik Winter Internship 2027?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">Only 2027 graduates from circuital branches with a CGPA of 8.0 or above who can work onsite in Bangalore from January to May 2027.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">Which programming languages does Rubrik expect from intern applicants?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">For the two engineering roles, Rubrik asks for proficiency in at least one general-purpose language such as Java, C/C++, Scala or Python. The Program role needs SDLC and agile basics instead.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">Is remote work allowed for these Rubrik intern roles?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">No. All three internships are onsite at Rubrik&rsquo;s Bangalore office, and the job posts state that no remote option is available.</p>\n</details>\n<details style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8E5;border-radius:10px;padding:12px 16px;margin:0 0 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:16.5px;color:#123D28;cursor:pointer;\">How do I apply for the Rubrik Winter Internship 2027?</summary>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 2px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;color:#24312B;\">Open the Rubrik careers page for the role you want (Job IDs 8166523, 8166537 or 8166514), click Apply and submit the Greenhouse form with your resume.</p>\n</details>\n<p><a id=\"fh-apply-src\" href=\"https://www.rubrik.com/company/careers/departments/job.8166523?gh_jid=8166523\" rel=\"nofollow sponsored noopener\" hidden target=\"_blank\">Apply on official portal</a></p>\n</div>\n<p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"JobPosting\",\"title\":\"Software Engineer - Winter Intern\",\"description\":\"Five-month onsite software engineering internship in Bangalore from January to May 2027. Interns design, build, test and improve product software. Open to 2027 graduates of circuital branches with CGPA 8 and above.\",\"identifier\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Rubrik\",\"value\":\"8166523\"},\"datePosted\":\"2026-09-06\",\"hiringOrganization\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Rubrik\",\"sameAs\":\"https://www.rubrik.com\"},\"jobLocation\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Bengaluru\",\"addressRegion\":\"Karnataka\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"}},\"employmentType\":\"INTERN\",\"directApply\":false,\"educationRequirements\":\"Bachelor's or Master's degree (2027 graduates, circuital branches, CGPA 8 and above)\"}</script><br />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"JobPosting\",\"title\":\"Software Engineer (CPD) - Winter Intern\",\"description\":\"Five-month onsite internship in the Continuous Product Development team in Bangalore, January to May 2027, working on established products end to end. Open to 2027 graduates of circuital branches with CGPA 8 and above.\",\"identifier\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Rubrik\",\"value\":\"8166537\"},\"datePosted\":\"2026-09-06\",\"hiringOrganization\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Rubrik\",\"sameAs\":\"https://www.rubrik.com\"},\"jobLocation\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Bengaluru\",\"addressRegion\":\"Karnataka\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"}},\"employmentType\":\"INTERN\",\"directApply\":false,\"educationRequirements\":\"Bachelor's or Master's degree (2027 graduates, circuital branches, CGPA 8 and above)\"}</script><br />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"JobPosting\",\"title\":\"ENG Project/ Program - Intern\",\"description\":\"Five-month onsite programme management internship in Bangalore, January to May 2027, supporting planning, tracking and delivery of engineering programmes. Open to 2027 graduates of circuital branches with CGPA 8 and above.\",\"identifier\":{\"@type\":\"PropertyValue\",\"name\":\"Rubrik\",\"value\":\"8166514\"},\"datePosted\":\"2026-09-06\",\"hiringOrganization\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"Rubrik\",\"sameAs\":\"https://www.rubrik.com\"},\"jobLocation\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\",\"addressLocality\":\"Bengaluru\",\"addressRegion\":\"Karnataka\",\"addressCountry\":\"IN\"}},\"employmentType\":\"INTERN\",\"directApply\":false,\"educationRequirements\":\"Bachelor's or Master's degree (2027 graduates, circuital branches, CGPA 8 and above)\"}</script><br />\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is the stipend for the Rubrik Winter Internship 2027?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Rubrik has not disclosed it. Indian job-board listings for earlier Rubrik winter intern roles report about &#8377;1&ndash;1.8 lakh per month, but this is unverified. Confirm the figure in your offer letter.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Who is eligible for the Rubrik Winter Internship 2027?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Only 2027 graduates from circuital branches with a CGPA of 8.0 or above who can work onsite in Bangalore from January to May 2027.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Which programming languages does Rubrik expect from intern applicants?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"For the two engineering roles, Rubrik asks for proficiency in at least one general-purpose language such as Java, C/C++, Scala or Python. The Program role needs SDLC and agile basics instead.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is remote work allowed for these Rubrik intern roles?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. All three internships are onsite at Rubrik&rsquo;s Bangalore office, and the job posts state that no remote option is available.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"How do I apply for the Rubrik Winter Internship 2027?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Open the Rubrik careers page for the role you want (Job IDs 8166523, 8166537 or 8166514), click Apply and submit the Greenhouse form with your resume.\"}}]}</script></p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\" class=\"sharethis-inline-share-buttons\" ></div>",
